            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Antonio Arteaga\u2011Martinez is a citizen of Mexico who was removed in July\u202f2012 and re\u2011entered the United States in September\u202f2012."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0aeadfe36e462b140606a8a880f5094c728c75133655604b4eb73b639001526a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0aeadfe36e46-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) issued a warrant for Arteaga\u2011Martinez\u2019s arrest in 2018."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d018fbc8512df656af15d2d953cd3261bcf7c582a1d96e74b8e5b920601bc3ae",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d018fbc8512d-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the question presented is whether the language of \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(6) that allows certain non\u2011citizens to be detained beyond the removal period requires that they be afforded a bond hearing before an immigration judge after six months of detention, with the government bearing the burden of proving by clear and convincing evidence that the non\u2011citizen is a flight risk or a danger to the community."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question Presented",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "case_id": "2021-19-896",
  "decision": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0aeadfe36e462b140606a8a880f5094c728c75133655604b4eb73b639001526a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0aeadfe36e46-0000-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(6) does not expressly require bond hearings after the 90\u2011day removal period for detainees in the four statutory categories."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0aeadfe36e462b140606a8a880f5094c728c75133655604b4eb73b639001526a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0aeadfe36e46-0000-0010"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court further held that there is no plausible construction of \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(6) that obligates the government to provide bond hearings before immigration judges after six months, nor to bear the burden of proving a detainee\u2019s flight risk or danger by clear and convincing evidence."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Decision",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
