              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 11,
                "start": 11
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Respondents argue that regulations provide custody hearings for non\u2011citizens deemed \u201cspecially dangerous\u201d under \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(6)."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Arteaga-Martinez",
          "citations": [
