              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 12,
                "start": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Arteaga-Martinez, according to Arteaga\u2011Martinez, reading \u00a7\u202f1231(a)(6) to not require bond hearings raises serious due\u2011process concerns because prolonged detention without an individualized hearing has never been authorized outside the national\u2011security context."
        },
